.DS_Store
target
*.log

# integration/tests/http_server.rs writes a freshly generated P256 private
# key under this per-run directory to stand up parser_http_server for the
# test; never let it linger on a shared CI runner's filesystem uncovered.
*-http-server-workdir

# qos_core's dev-mode EPHEMERAL_KEY_FILE default (see parser_http_server's
# `vsock` feature comment in Cargo.toml) writes the ephemeral key under
# `./local-enclave/qos.ephemeral.key` when the binary runs locally without
# `--features vsock`; generated, not checked in.
parser/http-server/local-enclave/